  "name": "LLMDyno",
  "description": "LLMDyno is an open-source benchmark for running local and cloud LLMs as coding agents. It runs agent harnesses on multi-file coding tasks in offline Docker sandboxes, grades them with hidden tests, static analysis and blind LLM judges, and compares correctness, code quality, speed, VRAM and cost. It is a web dashboard, a Python library, a command line and a TypeScript client.",
